          "Kind": "Method",
          "StartLine": 23,
          "EndLine": 28,
          "Code": "        /// \u003Creturns\u003E\u003Cparamref name=\u0022payload\u0022 /\u003E decrypted\u003C/returns\u003E\r\n        public static byte[] DecryptAes128Ctr( byte[] key, byte[] iv, byte[] payload )\r\n        {\r\n            return new AesCtrCrypto( key, iv ).Decrypt( payload );\r\n        }\r\n"
